    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "SecNumCloud also have incident response capabilities, including detection, notification, and remediation, aligned with GDPR breach-notification workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of audit capabilities, SecNumCloud explainability and auditability features support internal quality control and statutory audit review, ensuring reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "SecNumCloud product, Atelier, provides grounded and traceable figures or factual statements, and SecNumCloud maintain a complete audit trail." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, SecNumCloud will ensure that SecNumCloud solution is designed to respect professional secrecy, confidentiality of client data, and auditor's independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "SecNumCloud will implement measures to prevent leakage of data between client files and ensure strict partitioning of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "SecNumCloud hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent will guarantee compliance with sovereignty and security requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, SecNumCloud certifications, experience with EU regulatory frameworks, and security controls make SecNumCloud well-suited to address the key security and compliance considerations for this tender response." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires complying with GDPR, maintaining auditor's independence, respecting professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, and ensuring reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also be non-decisional assistance tool, respect anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture (GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the key legal risks and considerations for this tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Legal Agent for our company's, I have assessed the client's requirements against our company's context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's experience in contractual matters with private firms, regulated professions, and public-sector clients, our company's can address several of the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, regarding GDPR compliance, our company's is familiar with maintaining GDPR obligations as part of our company's regulatory compliance framework. our company's ensure that personal data is processed in accordance with the GDPR principles, including data minimization, accuracy, and storage limitation. our company's standard contractual clauses include provisions for data protection agreements, which align with Article 28 of GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, our company's understand the importance of maintaining auditor's independence and respecting professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a company, our company's are familiar with professional secrecy expectations in our company's contractual experience, particularly with clients bound by such obligations. our company's contractual framework includes confidentiality undertakings that protect sensitive information shared between our company's and our company's clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, regarding reliability and traceability of outputs, our company's Atelier platform, being proprietary software owned by our company's, ensures that the client retains full ownership of the client documents, ingested corpus, and produced data. our company's also provide for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract as part of our company's reversibility plan." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a non-decisional assistance tool, our company's solution is designed to support professionals without replacing professionals judgment, thus respecting the regulatory constraints around decision-making autonomy. our company's AI models are used under appropriate licenses, including open-weight licenses for sovereign European models and commercial licenses for proprietary third-party models, ensuring compliance with anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT) and other regulatory requirements. our company's also comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents through our company's maintained obligations monitored by the Security & Compliance function. our company's professional liability insurance of 10 million euros per claim provides coverage against potential risks associated with our company's services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must note that while our company's have a strong foundation in GDPR compliance, auditor independence, professional secrecy, and reliability of outputs, there may be specific requirements or nuances in French law or the accounting sector that are not explicitly covered in our company's standard contractual framework." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is essential to review and potentially adapt our company's contracts to ensure full alignment with the client's regulatory environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, based on our company's context as of 2025, our company's can address key legal risks and considerations for this tender response by leveraging our company's experience in GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, confidentiality, reliability, and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, a detailed review of specific French regulations and sectorial requirements is necessary to ensure comprehensive alignment with the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has a budget allocated to the project of €220,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual operating cost must remain controlled and compatible with The client capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's financials, active project budgets, daily rates, overhead, cash position, tender eligibility thresholds, and cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024, what is our company's projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our company's can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, an engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within our company's normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget envelope for the project indicates that one-off project costs account for 40% of the total budget, which would be €88,000, and recurring run costs account for 60%, which would be €132,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our company's target gross margin is between 25% and 35%, our company's can estimate the projected cost for this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total revenue from this contract is €220,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve a 25% gross margin, the total cost should be around €165,000 (€220,000 / 1.25 - 1), and to achieve a 35% gross margin, the total cost should be around €143,000 (€220,000 / 1.35 - 1) but these calculations are simplified and do not take into account specifics such as project costs structure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while maintaining the required quality of service, our company's could propose using our company's more cost-efficient tiers or models for hosting and inference. our company's approach favors cost-efficient configurations that protect the gross margin and predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, as part of our company's financial management, our company's maintain a three-year cost model that can be re-run if requirements or budgets change, ensuring flexibility and adaptability in managing project expenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, based on our company's context and the client's budget, our company's should be able to achieve a gross margin within our company's target range while proposing cost-optimization strategies to ensure compatibility with the client's capacity for annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence assistance solution that can provide explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs. an artificial intelligence assistance solution that can provide explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs must also integrate with existing production tools, electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment, user directory SSO, and be hosted on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what is the proposed AI innovation strategy for an artificial intelligence assistance solution that can provide explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs? the proposed AI innovation strategy for this solution intelligence assistance solution that can provide explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs leverages our company's core approach to Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which grounds answers in validated material." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which grounds answers in validated material ensures reliability and explainability of outputs, directly addressing The client requirements.  our company's will utilize our company's hybrid retrieval capabilities, combining lexical and semantic search to efficiently surface relevant information from The client controlled corpus. our company's RAG model will then generate answers based on relevant information from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring that every output is linked back to every output source passage, thus providing traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing production tools, electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment, and user directory SSO, our company's will employ our company's template-guided drafting capabilities. employ allows our company's to generate documents and reports in formats compatible with The client systems, ensuring seamless integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting, our company's can accommodate the requirement for SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent, as our company's model options include a Sovereign European open-weight model that is fully auditable and suitable for sovereignty-driven requirements. our company's iterative methodology involves corpus curation with our company's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our iterative methodology will ensure that the solution meets the client's specific needs while maintaining high standards of explainability and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our company's model selection principle trades off performance against explainability and sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's emphasis on explainability and sovereignty, our company's would opt for a configuration that prioritizes transparency and control over raw performance, where necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, our company's explainability features, including source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and comprehensive logging for auditing, will provide the required level of transparency into the decision-making process of the AI system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that the solution not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations regarding reliability, traceability, and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that has limited environmental footprint, is low-carbon, and ensures data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what are the key CSR and sustainability considerations for this tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at our company's, our company's has a published CSR statement and an EcoVadis Silver rating. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone assessment and cover scope 1, 2, and main scope 3 items in our company's greenhouse gas emissions reporting, including cloud inference.  our company's carbon intensity reduction trajectory is published, and our company's report deployment footprint to clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of environmental capabilities, our company's partner with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud in the EU, which uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and reuses heat. our company's also practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding social commitments, our company's are a signatory to the responsible tech charter, have gender balance and inclusion objectives, and participate in an apprenticeship and work-study program with the Grenoble research ecosystem. our company's accessibility standards are RGAA-aligned." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of AI ethics, our company's principles include human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and a documented data-use policy, all aligned with the EU AI Act and reviewed by compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For this tender response, key CSR and sustainability considerations include ensuring our company's solution aligns with the client's requirements for limited environmental footprint and low-carbon infrastructure. our company's existing partnership with green hosting partners and commitment to digital sobriety practices can support limited environmental footprint and low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's data sovereignty commitments, such as hosting data within the EU and not transferring data outside, can address the client's data sovereignty concerns." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of missions between collaborators by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress client file, and an efficient resumption by another collaborator.  4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's must also acknowledge known CSR tensions, such as the trade-off between premium tiers and energy consumption, ensuring that any solution presented with any solution presented with its associated footprint associated footprint is explicit about known CSR tensions, such as the trade-off between premium tiers and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
