    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on The client requirements and our company context, I propose an architecture that leverages our existing Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution will be hosted on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring the strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data. an architecture that leverages our existing Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform will consist of the following components: 1. **Atelier Platform**: our existing Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform will provide the intelligent assistance tool, capable of handling complex queries and providing grounded responses with source citations. 2. **Sovereign European Open-Weight Model**: our will utilize our hosted Sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully sovereign, auditable, and provides strong grounding/citation behavior. 3. **Integration with Existing Tools**: our API-first approach (REST + webhook) will enable seamless integration with The client existing production tools, electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment, and user directory SSO. 4. **Containerization using Kubernetes**: To ensure high availability and scalability, our will containerize The solution using Kubernetes, allowing for efficient resource allocation and automatic scaling during seasonal peak loads. 5. **Performance Optimization**: our platform is designed to sustain performance during seasonal peak loads, with a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds. 6. **Explainability**: Our platform provides explainability features, such as tracing the source of information and providing citations, ensuring transparency and trust in The solution outputs. 7. **Security and Access Control**: our will implement strict access controls, ensuring that client data is strictly partitioned and audited per client file, with single sign-on (SSO) using SAML or OIDC protocols. an architecture that leverages our existing Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform addresses the client's requirements for handling strong seasonality of workload, ensuring professional secrecy and confidentiality, providing an intelligent assistance tool, integrating with existing tools, and sustaining performance during peak loads, while also providing explainability and security features." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires ensuring strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, complying with GDPR, and maintaining auditor's independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also ensure confidentiality and security, have reliability and traceability of outputs, and be hosted on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given SecNumCloud certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, what are the key security and compliance considerations for this tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on SecNumCloud context, SecNumCloud have relevant certifications such as ISO 27001 and ISO 27701, which demonstrate SecNumCloud ability to manage information security and privacy." ;
